  "decision_reason": "Borrowed rational and structural comparisons preserve exact witnesses. The rational first-query median drops from 0.678 to 0.185 ms; copied-coordinate first queries drop from 0.184 to 0.078 ms. Other symbolic rows show mixed small shifts, including 5.2% higher constant-offset prepared-repeat and 4.2% higher pi-transport repeat medians. Query aggregate is 224.694 versus 218.688 ms, but short samples do not isolate the structural check contribution or establish a general speedup.",
